# Sample .gitignore for .booth/shared/home/coder/.config/pcmanfm-qt/
# Copy here when committing a team icon layout with +desktop-icons-shared.
#
# The pcmanfm-qt profile holds the desktop icon positions the extension is for,
# but also a record of recently opened files — personal browsing history that
# does not belong in a shared repository. Commit the layout, not the history.

*
!.gitignore
!.mount-this
!lxqt/
lxqt/*
!lxqt/desktop-items-*.conf

# File-manager preferences — uncomment if the team wants them shared too.
# !lxqt/settings.conf
